{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dato of Srivijaya is historical real time strategy set in  7th century at  Southeast Asia after Funan empire in Indocina has fall and regional power has shift </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >to Srivijaya, unknown kingdom which rise from upstream South Sumatra's  river to emerging great maritime power  in Asia for several centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Version 1.1 has released in 3 March 2022 with many new things!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1454410/extras/54cb0a6b0dc4871d0048eb3418939e67.avif?t=1756311548\" width=768 height=410 /></span>Follow path of Srivijaya\u2019s Maharaja(king of king) build his empire  from small power,conquest against his rivals and another kingdom in  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sland of gold (Svarnadwipa) and island of rice (Yavadvipa), maintain diplomatic relations to foreign power around world, and build strong navy for defending Srivijaya empire from any threat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;Build empire and manage federation (<i>kadatuan</i>) government system! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&gt;Explore Southeast Asia realm in 7th until 10th century from Borneo, Java, Sumatra, Malaya, and Indocina .</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&gt;Explore river states around East Sumatra which make ships can enter to river upstream! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;Deal with many kingdoms in Southeast Asia either friendly approch or conquest for maitain the power of <i>mandala</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;Manage system of city for build the state(Vanua) and estabilsh trading system, and countryside for supporting city needs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&gt;Experience playing not only Srivijaya but also all kingdoms in Southeast Asia.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game was funded by Indonesia Ministry of Education and Culture under 2th Facilitation in the FIeld of Culture Project <i>(Fasilitasi Bidang Kebudayaan</i>) 2020!</strong>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"RULER OF SVARNADVIPA","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1454410/bc5abf9b36f1514fc3139f82e433220fa2846f07.jpg"},{"name":"Formation of Srivijaya","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1454410/8d80d1eb8fd7907c4e486f10b975a865a4f80db4.jpg"},{"name":"Ruler of Javadvipa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1454410/2694c1fea793f5eeb7f19ec5686a5639032048b2.jpg"},{"name":"Ruler of Pasundan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1454410/2197ab4b7c9129b97d21b9384849a1a3b67939aa.jpg"},{"name":"Ruler of Borneo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1454410/c25b506042082274d69b910af7cf54a055027e2c.jpg"},{"name":"Ruler of Indocina","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1454410/0504f6922f88fd9491f2ce622d34b3cf7088fc5d.jpg"},{"name":"Ruler of Malaya","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1454410/b4f1ec02bb1f4eafb0e42da59203daab9705ecc1.jpg"},{"name":"Glory in sea","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1454410/c55cfc545f71df0ee9f42d8b3193c48e2a082cff.jpg"},{"name":"Ruler of Pasundan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1454410/2197ab4b7c9129b97d21b9384849a1a3b67939aa.jpg"},{"name":"Ruler of Javadvipa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1454410/2694c1fea793f5eeb7f19e