p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&gt;Explore Southeast Asia realm in 7th until 10th century from Borneo, Java, Sumatra, Malaya, and Indocina .</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&gt;Explore river states around East Sumatra which make ships can enter to river upstream! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;Deal with many kingdoms in Southeast Asia either friendly approch or conquest for maitain the power of <i>mandala</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&gt;Manage system of city for build the state(Vanua) and estabilsh trading system, and countryside for supporting city needs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&gt;Experience playing not only Srivijaya but also all kingdoms in Southeast Asia.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game was funded by Indonesia Ministry of Education and Culture under 2th Facilitation in the FIeld of Culture Project <i>(Fasilitasi Bidang Kebudayaan</i>) 2020!</strong>.</p>","developers":["Sengkala Dev"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1454410/header.jpg?t=1756311548","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Dato of Srivijaya developed by Sengkala Dev and funded by Indonesia Ministry of Education and Culture under Facilitation of Culture Project 2020. This game is free for play and copyright under Sengkala Dev and Indonesia Ministry of Education and Culture.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1454410/1866052446/02d6a2e94a3dab29c06fbd1473b502da591a1e73/1756311132/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756311546","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1454410/1866052446/02d6a2e94a3dab29c06fbd1473b502da591a1e73/17